## 10. Security Practices
        -  Do not log personal health information (PHI)
        -  Validate all user input
        -  Encrypt sensitive data in the database
        -  Use HTTPS / TLS in all environments
        -  Enforce RBAC and JWT-based authentication
        -  Optional: OWASP ZAP vulnerability scans
        -  For reporting vulnerabilities, refer to SECURITY.md.

